 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/07/10 09:48| 01 | 289| 008| 0268| 0035| 0238| 0335|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/09 21:00| 02 | 282| 038| 0423| 0122| 0216| 0650|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/09 17:00| 01 | 101| 032| 0254| 0018| 0212| 0272|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/09 08:00| 01 | 219| 036| 0281| 0013| 0257| 0297|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/08 13:48| 01 | 294| 038| 0246| 0104| 0200| 0480|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/08 11:36| 01 | 274| 006| 071"
